WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Brother-in-law, Song Yuan is very good.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Obedient and down-to-earth, willing to work hard and able to endure hardships

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,890
That's good

4
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:11,460
Uncle, are you here to see the boat?

5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,460
Yes, wash your face quickly

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,460
Let's find an old boat and throw it to the shipyard together.

7
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,460
He has rich experience and can check things for us.

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:25,340
This is really a shipyard

9
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,340
Qi Ye, actually I’m not so sure either.

10
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,340
You don't need to review it for me

11
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,340
Maybe we can do it in the county

12
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,340
Find a better big boat yard and check it out

13
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:33,340
Silly boy, what did you say?

14
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,340
This is the best and largest boatyard in our county.

15
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,340
If it's better, we'll have to go to the city.

16
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,340
But the city is far away

17
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,340
Returning to the site for repairs is troublesome.

18
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:42,340
Please come over to the old boat. It’s really the right thing to do.

19
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,340
If he hadn't said it, I wouldn't have thought of beating him to death.

20
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,340
Zhiqiang Shipbuilding Yard is in such a state of ruin

21
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,340
It is actually the largest boat yard in the entire county.
